{
  "version": 4,
  "purpose": "Live visual decor for Lammatna v2 (wider hall and outdoor garden). Gameplay and collider definitions remain separate.",
  "notes": [
    "Earlier decor placements are kept with the same models, sizes and rotations, moved to their areas in the wider hall; their hand-made colliders stay in shared/playground.js (IMPORTED_DECOR_SOLIDS).",
    "collide: 'box' uses the placed model's bounds, 'trunk' a thin centre post, 'children' one box per top-level child of a starter scene (floors, tiles, trusses and mats are skipped; trampoline beds become bounce pads).",
    "origin: true places the model's own origin at position (starter scenes keep their internal layout); merge: true merges the scene's meshes per material after colliders are taken.",
    "Colliders generated here only affect local movement and the camera; the room server never needs them because minigame areas are kept clear of decor."
